{"overview":"تیمی متشکل از فوتبالیست های دختر دبیرستانی با استعداد که به بازماندگان (غیر) خوش شانس یک سقوط هواپیما در عمق بیابان انتاریو تبدیل می شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"This equal parts survival epic, psychological horror story and coming-of-age drama tells the saga of a team of wildly talented high school girls soccer players who become the (un)lucky survivors of a plane crash deep in the remote northern wilderness. The series chronicles their descent from a complicated but thriving team to savage clans, while also tracking the lives they’ve attempted to piece back together nearly 25 years later.","tagline_en":"We hear the wilderness and it hears us.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":12,"y":2022,"poster":"/bDUEqyVi2xaSBf1CY8l6u3O3kVP.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2021,"poster":"/XtnjzjjFAnmTEiDk4xu7diCvMF.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":9,"y":2023,"poster":"/o4Ql7oU2W3U8RyeDoSREDdKvTlq.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/agBOgS5q1QxvaiM8TDzNTnq2EIs.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":3,"y":2026,"poster":"/wWLiDEnHRTXgrEDymgcFhzKFdzk.jpg"}],"episodes":32,"crew":["Ashley Lyle","Bart Nickerson"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["CA","US"],"cast":[{"name":"ملانی لینسکی","role":"Shauna Sadecki","photo":"/kzrWI1sTgnA0H7TCIKzDOUtOW4n.jpg","en":"Melanie Lynskey"},{"name":"Tawny Cypress","role":"Taissa Turner","photo":"/9Ar9G1Uye2e2ZiTTiYrn1MutBis.jpg"},{"name":"Sophie Nélisse","role":"Teen Shauna Shipman","photo":"/gRznDS7CEKllld5wqxxUcaE0DWW.jpg"},{"name":"Jasmin Savoy Brown","role":"Teen Taissa Turner","photo":"/yWaCA2iKmVps20SFxwiB1DvbN6j.jpg"},{"name":"سوفی تاچر","role":"Teen Natalie Scatorccio","photo":"/s7wB4ORCwPPz7H3dWVCNSAKQz9P.jpg","en":"Sophie Thatcher"},{"name":"Sammi Hanratty","role":"Teen Misty Quigley","photo":"/gdNN4Xqm8BACyf92c9q3GNPpjsh.jpg"},{"name":"Warren Kole","role":"Jeff Sadecki","photo":"/rwJHDXng0zn4QWhAP36tfhkXWjt.jpg"},{"name":"کریستینا ریچی","role":"Misty Quigley